<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Kingspan Group yr pretax profit up 117 pct.</title>
<headline>Kingspan Group yr pretax profit up 117 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)				   37.8   vs 18.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)			     2.8   vs  2.3</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)		     4.5   vs  3.7</p>
<p> Pretax  profit				13.26  vs 6.11</p>
<p> Turnover				     126.13  vs 83.36</p>
<p>NOTE - Kingspan Group Plc is an Irish building products manufacturer.</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 353-1-661-3377</p>
</text>
